      "content": "it's weird, hearing you say that... it feels like a relief, almost. like i don't have to pretend to be brave anymore. everyone else is running around panicking, trying to save things that are already lost. but if there really is no point in the struggle, then what's the point of waiting for the end to just happen to you? is there a way to actually take some control back from all this chaos?",
